  "body": "Freshly renovated, beautifully presented and filled with natural light, this impressive five- bedroom home delivers the space, flexibility and easy living modern families are looking for in sought-after Millwater.\r\n\r\nSet across two generous levels, the home has been refreshed with new paint inside and out, along with new carpet throughout, including the garage. With a sunny aspect and all-day sun, the interiors feel warm and welcoming, while quality construction by a well-known Millwater builder adds to the home’s enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, high ceilings enhance the sense of space, with the open-plan kitchen, dining and living forming the heart of the home. Designed for both everyday family life and entertaining, this inviting space flows seamlessly outdoors to a sunny, private deck and landscaped garden – perfect for summer barbecues, relaxed weekends and time with family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout provides excellent separation when you need it. Two bedrooms and a bathroom downstairs offer fantastic flexibility for guests, extended family or a teenager’s retreat. Upstairs, three further bedrooms are complemented by an additional living area and elevated views.\r\n\r\nThe generous master suite provides a relaxing retreat, complete with a spacious walk-in wardrobe and ensuite featuring double basins and a bathtub.\r\n\r\nEveryday comfort and practicality have also been well considered, with underfloor heating in all bathrooms, central vacuum, a double internal-access garage and three additional off-street parking spaces – including valuable room for a boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned close to local schools, shops and parks, with easy motorway access and Orewa Beach just a short drive away, this is a home that brings together space, sunshine and lifestyle in one exceptional family package.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n\r\n• Five generous bedrooms – three upstairs and two downstairs, ideal for families, guests or a teenager’s retreat\r\n• Multiple living areas across two levels, with high ceilings downstairs\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Generous master suite with walk-in wardrobe, ensuite, double basins and bathtub\r\n• Newly renovated with fresh paint inside and out, plus new carpet throughout, including the garage\r\n• Sunny, light-filled living with all-day sun, opening to a private deck and landscaped garden\r\n• Underfloor heating in all bathrooms plus central vacuum for everyday comfort\r\n• Double internal-access garage plus three off-street parks, including space for a boat or caravan\r\n• Convenient to local schools, shops, parks and motorway access, with Orewa Beach a short drive away\r\n\r\nFreshly renovated, family-sized and ready to enjoy, 26 Harris Drive offers the space and flexibility to grow, entertain and make yourself at home. Don’t miss your opportunity to make this impressive Millwater property yours.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.",
